3	line	Player	What do you mean?
3	line	Redbeard Frank	The Customs office has been clampin' down on the export of spirits. You seem like a resourceful young [lad/lass], I'm sure ye'll be able to find a way to slip the stuff past them.
3	line	Player	Well I'll give it a shot.
3	line	Redbeard Frank	Arr, that's the spirit!
3	action	end
2	option	No.
