0	section	Talking to Luthas
1	line	Luthas	Hello I'm Luthas, I run the banana plantation here.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Could you offer me employment on your plantation?
2	line	Player	Could you offer me employment on your plantation?
2	line	Luthas	Yes, I can sort something out. There's a crate ready to be loaded onto the ship.
2	line	Luthas	You wouldn't believe the demand for bananas from Wydin's shop over in Port Sarim. I think this is the third crate I've shipped him this month..
2	line	Luthas	If you could fill it up with bananas, I'll pay you 30 gold.
2	action	end
1	option	That customs officer is annoying isn't she?
2	line	Player	That customs officer is annoying isn't she?
2	line	Luthas	Well I know her pretty well. She doesn't cause me any trouble any more.
2	line	Luthas	She doesn't even search my export crates any more. She knows they only contain bananas.
2	line	Player	Really? How interesting. Whereabouts do you send those to?
2	line	Luthas	There is a little shop over in Port Sarim that buys them up by the crate. I believe it is run by a man called Wydin.
2	action	end
