1	line	Player	Yes, I've got some.
1	line	Redbeard Frank	Now a deal's a deal, I'll tell ye about the treasure. I used to serve under a pirate captain called One-Eyed Hector.
1	line	Redbeard Frank	Hector were very successful and became very rich. But about a year ago we were boarded by the Customs and Excise Agents.
1	line	Redbeard Frank	Hector were killed along with many of the crew, I were one of the few to escape and I escaped with this.
1	box	Frank happily takes the rum... and hands you a key.
1	line	Redbeard Frank	This be Hector's key. I believe it opens his chest in his old room in the Blue Moon Inn in Varrock.
1	line	Redbeard Frank	With any luck his treasure will be in there.
